# See customer-service/.trivyignore for the general reasoning. api-gateway's list is entirely
# different from the 4 REST backends' because it's a WebFlux/Netty app (Spring Cloud Gateway),
# not a Tomcat/MVC one — no Tomcat CVEs here, but Netty (the reactive HTTP client/server) and
# Spring Cloud Gateway itself contribute their own. Verified via
# `trivy image --severity HIGH,CRITICAL bss/api-gateway:test` after the same 3.2.4 -> 3.2.12
# bump applied to the other services (pom.xml). Same follow-up applies: a Boot 3.3/3.4 +
# matching Spring Cloud release train migration is the real fix, out of scope for Giai đoạn 1.

